  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "儀器分析與感測技術",
    "sub_ename": "INSTRUMENTAL ANALYSIS AND SENSING TECHNOLOGY",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主旨為學生提供相關儀器分析與感測技術之理論與實際應用的知識。課程涵蓋學習各類基礎與新型儀器類型，包括光譜儀、質譜儀、旋光度計、電化學儀器與磁性量測儀等。將了解各類分析儀器的原理和材料分析與應用領域。同時本課程介紹各類型感測器技術，包括生物、化學和物理感測器等。學習設計、製造和感測器開發以檢測特定的分子、元素或環境條件的感測工具。",
    "describe_eh": "The primary objective of this course is to provide students with both theoretical knowledge and practical applications of relevant instrumental analysis and sensing technologies. The course covers a wide range of basic and advanced instrument types, including spectrometers, mass spectrometers, polarimeters, electrochemical instruments, and magnetic measurement devices. Students will gain an understanding of the principles behind various analytical instruments and their applications in materials analysis.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
